APIs for external data:
Location & Navigation
•	OpenStreetMap / Overpass API — fully free, no key needed; query nearby POIs including restaurants.
•	OpenRouteService — free routing/directions with ETA calculation.
Weather
•	Open-Meteo — completely free, no API key; returns current weather and forecasts by coordinates.
News & Search
•	NewsAPI — free tier for headlines by topic or keyword.
•	DuckDuckGo Instant Answer API — free, no key; returns structured info for factual queries.
Open Library API  Book metadata, covers, search by ISBN/title
TheMealDB
TheCocktailDB
Research papers:
http://export.arxiv.org/api/query?search_query=all:electron.
Finance
•	Yahoo Finance (unofficial) — widely used for stock quotes with no official key requirement.
